&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> cur&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>next&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>pre
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> pre&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>cur
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> cur&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>nxt
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic">#新的pre,cur分别是4，5&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic">#连接 2 和 5&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> p0&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>next&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>next&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>cur
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic">#连接1和4&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> p0&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>next&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>pre
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">return&lt;/span> dummy&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>next
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>反转链表关注 pre和cur在开始前和结束后的位置，在这一题中，旧pre的next为新的pre，旧cur的 next为新的cur.
